    "title": "Pokedoku Unlimited",
    "description": "Pokedoku Unlimited (www.pokedoku-unlimited.org) is an endless Pok\u00e8 Wordle quiz game version of the popular Pok\u00e8 Sudoku game. You can play infinite games, or choose from the archive. Each game offers up to 9 attempts, allowing players to either restart and play an unlimited number of times or choose a completely different game from the archive.\r\n\r\nPokedoku is a unique grid-based puzzle game where each player must match Pok\u00e9mon to specific criteria on a grid. Every game features a unique grid with coordinates marked as X and Y, representing different characteristics like Types, Generations, Legendary, Mythical, Baby, and more.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Pokedoku Unlimited (www.pokedoku-unlimited.org) is an endless Pok\u00e8 Wordle quiz game version of the popular Pok\u00e8 Sudoku game. You can play infinite games, or choose from the archive. Each game offers up to 9 attempts, allowing players to either restart and play an unlimited number of times or choose a completely different game from the archive.<br><br>Pokedoku is a unique grid-based puzzle game where each player must match Pok\u00e9mon to specific criteria on a grid. Every game features a unique grid with coordinates marked as X and Y, representing different characteristics like Types, Generations, Legendary, Mythical, Baby, and more.",
